<?xml version='1.1' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<flow-definition plugin="workflow-job">
  <description>main 전용 Runner 자원 관측 Job — tests/jenkins/harness/perf_observe.py 를 지정 노드에서 돌려 같은 Runner 의 Gather 빌드(SE_BUILD_ID 귀속) PSS·RSS·활성 worker·MemAvailable·swap 을 샘플링한다(읽기 전용 /proc). 운영 수집 Job 이 아니다. 정의: tests/jenkins/harness/Jenkinsfile_perf_observe (Branch */main). 2026-10-04 최종 실행 지시 §7</description>
  <keepDependencies>false</keepDependencies>
  <properties>
    <hudson.model.ParametersDefinitionProperty>
      <parameterDefinitions>
        <hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
          <name>NODE_NAME</name>
          <defaultValue></defaultValue>
          <description>관측할 노드 이름(필수) — 예: SKHynix-Jenkins-Runner03</description>
          <trim>true</trim>
        </hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
        <hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
          <name>DURATION_SEC</name>
          <defaultValue>900</defaultValue>
          <description>최대 관측 시간(초)</description>
          <trim>true</trim>
        </hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
        <hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
          <name>INTERVAL_SEC</name>
          <defaultValue>2</defaultValue>
          <description>샘플 간격(초)</description>
          <trim>true</trim>
        </hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
        <hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
          <name>IDLE_EXIT_SEC</name>
          <defaultValue>90</defaultValue>
          <description>빌드를 본 뒤 이 시간(초) 동안 아무 빌드도 없으면 종료 (0 = 끝까지)</description>
          <trim>true</trim>
        </hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
        <hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
          <name>TAG</name>
          <defaultValue></defaultValue>
          <description>사람용 표식(측정 묶음 이름)</description>
          <trim>true</trim>
        </hudson.model.StringParameterDefinition>
      </parameterDefinitions>
    </hudson.model.ParametersDefinitionProperty>
    <jenkins.model.BuildDiscarderProperty>
      <strategy class="hudson.tasks.LogRotator">
        <daysToKeep>-1</daysToKeep>
        <numToKeep>100</numToKeep>
        <artifactDaysToKeep>-1</artifactDaysToKeep>
        <artifactNumToKeep>-1</artifactNumToKeep>
        <removeLastBuild>false</removeLastBuild>
      </strategy>
    </jenkins.model.BuildDiscarderProperty>
  </properties>
  <definition class="org.jenkinsci.plugins.workflow.cps.CpsScmFlowDefinition" plugin="workflow-cps">
    <scm class="hudson.plugins.git.GitSCM" plugin="git">
      <configVersion>2</configVersion>
      <userRemoteConfigs>
        <hudson.plugins.git.UserRemoteConfig>
          <url>https://github.com/hshwang1994/server-expoter</url>
          <credentialsId>hshwang token</credentialsId>
        </hudson.plugins.git.UserRemoteConfig>
      </userRemoteConfigs>
      <branches>
        <hudson.plugins.git.BranchSpec>
          <name>*/main</name>
        </hudson.plugins.git.BranchSpec>
      </branches>
      <doGenerateSubmoduleConfigurations>false</doGenerateSubmoduleConfigurations>
      <submoduleCfg class="empty-list"/>
      <extensions/>
    </scm>
    <scriptPath>tests/jenkins/harness/Jenkinsfile_perf_observe</scriptPath>
    <lightweight>true</lightweight>
  </definition>
  <triggers/>
  <disabled>false</disabled>
</flow-definition>
